v 3
d blankvar: blank out variables, whatever their storage type
d
d blankvar clears the listed variables for the observations selected
d by an optional if/in qualifier. String variables are set to "" and
d numeric variables to system missing (.), so one command replaces a
d run of hand-written -replace- statements when voiding records in a
d dataset with mixed column types.
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260926
d
d Author: Rana Redoan
d Support: https://github.com/RanaRedoan/blankvar/issues
d
f blankvar.ado
f blankvar.sthlp